Package: foottroller-hub
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Foottroller Crampon gamepad and network Hub
 Read a Foottroller Crampon joystick in Dev mode and provide locomotion
 through a Linux virtual gamepad and the Foottroller UDP game integration.
 The Hub starts on demand and keeps its mapping in one configuration file.
